The profile shows the main opportunity is not the triangle `bmm`; for large `dim=384` it’s the input LayerNorm plus five hidden projections. There is already an unused fused LayerNorm+projection Triton kernel in the file, so I’m testing it as a route candidate before deciding whether to patch it in or write a variant.
